  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1226477,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1988 - The Demo (Commodore 64) - Synopsis\n\nStep into the high-stakes world of American politics with *1988 - The Demo* for the Commodore 64, a thrilling update to the classic election simulation, *President Elect*. This demo offers a taste of what it takes to navigate the treacherous path to the White House.\n\nAs a presidential candidate, you'll embark on a campaign journey, strategically managing your resources and public image. Travel across the United States, addressing rallies, debating opponents, and crafting policy platforms to sway voters.  The game realistically simulates the electoral process, factoring in issues like the economy, foreign policy, and social concerns. \n\n*1988 - The Demo* features simplified gameplay designed for quick, engaging sessions.  Experience the challenge of balancing popular appeal with political pragmatism. Can you secure enough electoral votes to claim victory and become the next President of the United States?  This demo provides a snapshot of the full game's potential, offering a compelling glimpse into the complexities of presidential campaigning."
    },
